## Model Governance

### Validation Process

| Phase | Activity | Frequency |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| Development | Cross-validation, holdout testing | Per version |
| Pre-Production | Prospective validation | Before release |
| Production | Performance monitoring | Continuous |
| Periodic Review | Full revalidation | Quarterly |

### Fairness & Bias

All models undergo fairness analysis across:
- Age groups
- Gender
- Race/ethnicity
- Insurance type
- Geography

**Fairness Metrics**:
| Metric | Threshold |
|--------|-----------|
| Equalized Odds Difference | <0.05 |
| Demographic Parity Ratio | 0.80-1.25 |
| Calibration by Group | <0.10 |

### Monitoring Dashboard

| Metric | Threshold | Alert |
|--------|-----------|-------|
| AUC degradation | >0.02 | Warning |
| AUC degradation | >0.05 | Critical |
| Prediction drift | >10% | Warning |
| Data quality | <95% | Warning |
| Latency p95 | >200ms | Warning |

